---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  current="home"
  title="ChargeVia by Rangeway | The stop that always works."
  description="ChargeVia by Rangeway is bringing fast charging to existing businesses with useful amenities, easy access, and people who care."
>
  <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <h1 id="hero-title">Fast charging at places worth stopping.</h1>
      <p class="lede">ChargeVia by Rangeway is bringing fast charging to existing businesses with easy access, useful amenities, and people who look after the place.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <Button href="/the-idea/">See the idea</Button>
        <a class="textlink" href="/site-hosts/">Have a property in mind?</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero__figure">
      <div class="hero__frame">
        <img
          src="/images/cv-retail-1672.webp"
          srcset="/images/cv-retail-640.webp 640w, /images/cv-retail-960.webp 960w, /images/cv-retail-1672.webp 1672w"
          sizes="(min-width: 1320px) 720px, (min-width: 980px) 55vw, calc(100vw - 40px)"
          alt="Concept rendering of electric vehicles charging beside a retail storefront with outdoor seating"
          width="1672"
          height="941"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
      </div>
      <figcaption>Concept rendering</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap home-place" aria-labelledby="place-title">
    <h2 id="place-title" class="h2">A good charging stop starts with a good place.</h2>
    <div class="home-place__copy">
      <p class="lede">We’re looking for properties with useful amenities, easy access, and people who look after the place.</p>
      <dl class="home-place__details">
        <div><dt>Easy to reach</dt><dd>A straightforward way in, and room to move around.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Worth the time</dt><dd>A coffee, food, a restroom, or a useful break. The mix depends on the property.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Looked after</dt><dd>A maintained property and a host who cares about visitors.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a class="textlink" href="/the-idea/">Read the idea <span aria-hidden="true">»</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section works" aria-labelledby="works-title">
    <figure class="figure figure--16x9 works__figure">
      <img
        src="/images/cv-night-1000.webp"
        srcset="/images/cv-night-640.webp 640w, /images/cv-night-1000.webp 1000w"
        sizes="(min-width: 1320px) 640px, (min-width: 900px) 50vw, calc(100vw - 40px)"
        alt="Concept rendering of a charging stop beneath an illuminated canopy at night"
        width="1000"
        height="558"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>Concept rendering</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="works__copy">
      <h2 id="works-title" class="h2 purple">The stop that always works.</h2>
      <p class="body">That is the standard we are building toward: charging you can count on, a property that is cared for, and a useful way to spend the stop.</p>
      <p class="body">Rangeway would develop and manage the charging. The host keeps running the business its customers already know.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap home-hosts" aria-labelledby="hosts-title">
    <div class="home-hosts__inner split split--end">
      <div class="cta__head">
        <p class="kicker">For site hosts</p>
        <h2 id="hosts-title" class="display">Have a place worth stopping?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cta__body">
        <p class="lede" style="max-width: 38ch">If you own or run a retail, fuel, or hospitality property that drivers already like to visit, we would like to hear about it.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <Button href="/site-hosts/" variant="ink">Explore hosting</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
